  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1756154553_2236499_971df7da0d00638562feda1cfd15eae2.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-family: &quot;Graphik Webfont&quot;, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.16px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\" id=\"isPasted\">The Transom Table is a family-owned business located in New Hampshire. Our handcrafted tables are made with all marine grade materials. Our Transom Tables are designed to mount to the transom grab bar. With our patented bracket design, our tables will adjust and accommodate most grab bars and angles. Our Cockpit tables are often used to replace existing boat tables. Whether you are looking for grilling, entertaining or out anchored at your favorite spot, you can count on our tables to bring that extra entertainment space that you have been looking for.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span id=\"isPasted\">Our Custom Boat Tables Feature:</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span>All marine grade materials</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span>Premium Quality</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span>Solid Wood</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span>Satisfaction Guaranteed</span></p></div></div>",
